<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 17.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 17.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   93/94     95/96     UNQ    153/154</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  97/99    100/102  160/162  170/175</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker market was stable with moderate enquiries on Thursday but sentiment was cautious over weakness in the cargo market, traders said. Due to recent cargo market falls, suppliers were slow in moving up offers despite better enquiries than last week.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
